"w":"beautiful","s":258.65,"e":259.3,"line":76},{"w":"day,","s":259.3,"e":259.59,"line":76},{"w":"One","s":259.59,"e":259.82,"line":77},{"w":"more","s":259.82,"e":260.13,"line":77},{"w":"chance","s":260.13,"e":260.6,"line":77},{"w":"to","s":260.6,"e":260.75,"line":77},{"w":"love","s":260.75,"e":261.06,"line":77},{"w":"along","s":261.06,"e":261.45,"line":77},{"w":"the","s":261.45,"e":261.68,"line":77},{"w":"way.","s":261.68,"e":261.99,"line":77},{"w":"A","s":261.99,"e":262.13,"line":78},{"w":"hundred","s":262.13,"e":262.64,"line":78},{"w":"books","s":262.64,"e":263,"line":78},{"w":"could","s":263,"e":263.36,"line":78},{"w":"never","s":263.36,"e":263.71,"line":78},{"w":"write","s":263.71,"e":264.07,"line":78},{"w":"The","s":264.07,"e":264.29,"line":79},{"w":"life","s":264.29,"e":264.59,"line":79},{"w":"you're","s":264.59,"e":265.03,"line":79},{"w":"making","s":265.03,"e":265.47,"line":79},{"w":"here","s":265.47,"e":265.76,"line":79},{"w":"tonight.","s":265.76,"e":266.35,"line":79},{"w":"Make","s":266.35,"e":266.64,"line":80},{"w":"one","s":266.64,"e":266.86,"line":80},{"w":"corner","s":266.86,"e":267.29,"line":80},{"w":"bright.","s":267.29,"e":267.8,"line":80},{"w":"Make","s":267.8,"e":268.09,"line":81},{"w":"one","s":268.09,"e":268.31,"line":81},{"w":"corner","s":268.31,"e":268.74,"line":81},{"w":"bright.","s":268.74,"e":269.25,"line":81},{"w":"And","s":269.25,"e":269.47,"line":82},{"w":"we'll","s":269.47,"e":269.85,"line":82},{"w":"shine","s":269.85,"e":270.22,"line":82},{"w":"a","s":270.22,"e":270.37,"line":82},{"w":"little","s":270.37,"e":270.81,"line":82},{"w":"brighter","s":270.81,"e":271.4,"line":82},{"w":"side","s":271.4,"e":271.7,"line":82},{"w":"by","s":271.7,"e":271.85,"line":82},{"w":"side.","s":271.85,"e":272.22,"line":82}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":3.28,"text":"A hundred books, a hundred roads,"},{"s":3.28,"e":5.37,"text":"A thousand ways a heart can grow."},{"s":5.37,"e":7.96,"text":"The endings differ, but one truth shines:"},{"s":7.96,"e":10.23,"text":"It's what we give that makes a life."},{"s":10.23,"e":13.96,"text":"An old knight fought a windmill in a storm of make-believe,"},{"s":13.96,"e":17.37,"text":"So I let imagination breathe, but question what I see."},{"s":17.37,"e":21.15,"text":"A young woman judged a stranger till her certainty gave way,"},{"s":21.15,"e":24.56,"text":"Now I leave a little room for what I don't know today."},{"s":24.56,"e":28.23,"text":"A hobbit left a warm house with his trembling little feet,"},{"s":28.23,"e":32.58,"text":"Turns out courage comes from moving, not from knowing you'll succeed."},{"s":32.58,"e":35.74,"text":"A boy upon a river chose a friend above the crowd,"},{"s":35.74,"e":39.84,"text":"Now I'll stand for what is decent, even when my voice ain't loud."},{"s":39.84,"e":43.76,"text":"A girl protected her own heart when the easy choice was wrong,"},{"s":43.76,"e":48.05,"text":"So my boundaries aren't a weakness, they're a way of staying strong."},{"s":48.05,"e":51.72,"text":"Every life is full of chapters no one else gets to choose,"},{"s":51.72,"e":55.57,"text":"And the first page of my future is the next right thing I do."},{"s":55.57,"e":58.6,"text":"Maybe wisdom isn't thunder falling from the sky,"},{"s":58.6,"e":61.76,"text":"Maybe it's the way we see the stranger passing by."},{"s":61.76,"e":65.42,"text":"Maybe joy's not at the finish of a race we're born to run,"},{"s":65.42,"e":68.77,"text":"Maybe it's the love we share beneath the morning sun."},{"s":68.77,"e":71.29,"text":"Turn the page, let the daylight through,"},{"s":71.29,"e":73.94,"text":"The story isn't over, and neither are you."},{"s":73.94,"e":76.97,"text":"Give a little grace, let the small things shine,"},{"s":76.97,"e":79.31,"text":"A hundred books, one heart, one life."},{"s":79.31,"e":83.16,"text":"Tell the truth, take a chance, let your kindness take flight,"},{"s":83.16,"e":86.26,"text":"If the world's too heavy, make one corner bright."},{"s":86.26,"e":89.35,"text":"You don't need the ending to know where to start,"},{"s":89.35,"e":92.19,"text":"Write another beautiful line with your heart."},{"s":92.19,"e":96.11,"text":"A sailor chased a white whale till the sea swallowed his name,"},{"s":96.11,"e":99.9,"text":"I won't turn my every heartbreak into someone else to blame."},{"s":99.9,"e":103.5,"text":"A mansion full of music couldn't purchase something real,"},{"s":103.5,"e":107.54,"text":"So I'll treasure kitchen laughter and the hands that I can feel."},{"s":107.54,"e":111.01,"text":"A maker loved the glory, left his creation in the cold,"},{"s":111.01,"e":114.99,"text":"I'll take care of what I'm building and the people that I hold."},{"s":114.99,"e":118.21,"text":"A miser saw tomorrow, turned his riches into gifts,"},{"s":118.21,"e":121.62,"text":"A man received forgiveness and discovered how to live."},{"s":121.62,"e":125.15,"text":"A little prince loved one rose beneath a thousand stars,"},{"s":125.15,"e":129.07,"text":"So I'll call the ones I cherish, tell them how loved they are."},{"s":129.07,"e":132.92,"text":"I'll say sorry without speeches, lend a hand without a stage,"},{"s":132.92,"e":136.84,"text":"Love is something that you practice, not a sentence on a page."},{"s":136.84,"e":139.36,"text":"Turn the page, let the daylight through,"},{"s":139.36,"e":142.01,"text":"The story isn't over, and neither are you."},{"s":142.01,"e":145.05,"text":"Give a little grace, let the small things shine,"},{"s":145.05,"e":147.38,"text":"A hundred books, one heart, one life."},{"s":147.38,"e":151.23,"text":"Tell the truth, take a chance, let your kindness take flight,"},{"s":151.23,"e":154.33,"text":"If the world's too heavy, make one corner bright."},{"s":154.33,"e":157.42,"text":"You don't need the ending to know where to start,"},{"s":157.42,"e":160.26,"text":"Write another beautiful line with your heart."},{"s":160.26,"e":164.05,"text":"Some books show how the powerful can teach the world to lie,"},{"s":164.05,"e":167.71,"text":"How a promise made for everyone can leave the weak behind."},{"s":167.71,"e":171.44,"text":"So I question, seek the evidence, and stand with open eyes,"},{"s":171.44,"e":175.1,"text":"Never trade my right to wonder for a comfortable disguise."},{"s":175.1,"e":178.51,"text":"A family crossed a country with so little left to own,"},{"s":178.51,"e":182.43,"text":"Found a lifeline in the kindness of the strangers on the road."},{"s":182.43,"e":186.09,"text":"A secret garden flourished when small hands began to care,"},{"s":186.09,"e":189.06,"text":"And a dreamer found a universe in ordinary air."},{"s":189.06,"e":192.66,"text":"I can change a tiny corner; there's a million more to go,"},{"s":192.66,"e":196.76,"text":"But a million little kindnesses are how brighter worlds can grow."},{"s":196.76,"e":199.92,"text":"So I make a little room for somebody else's story,"},{"s":199.92,"e":203.83,"text":"Shared success is so much sweeter than a lonely kind of glory."},{"s":203.83,"e":207.87,"text":"Some chapters end too early, some are written through the tears,"},{"s":207.87,"e":211.28,"text":"And love keeps quiet company across the passing years."},{"s":211.28,"e":215.33,"text":"You can miss a voice at dinner and still laugh at something new,"},{"s":215.33,"e":218.74,"text":"A sky can carry both the rain and every shade of blue."},{"s":218.74,"e":222.59,"text":"Tonight I'll name three little gifts, tomorrow call a friend,"},{"s":222.59,"e":226.06,"text":"Lay down what I can't control, pick up what I can mend."},{"s":226.06,"e":229.72,"text":"I can't erase all sorrow, but I can help somebody through,"},{"s":229.72,"e":233.76,"text":"And sometimes making someone smile brings my own smile back too."},{"s":233.76,"e":236.29,"text":"TURN THE PAGE! LET THE DAYLIGHT THROUGH!"},{"s":236.29,"e":238.94,"text":"THE STORY ISN'T OVER, AND NEITHER ARE YOU!"},{"s":238.94,"e":241.97,"text":"Give a little grace, let the small things shine,"},{"s":241.97,"e":244.31,"text":"A HUNDRED BOOKS, ONE HEART, ONE LIFE!"},{"s":244.31,"e":248.16,"text":"Tell the truth, take a chance, let your kindness take flight,"},{"s":248.16,"e":251.26,"text":"If the world's too heavy, MAKE ONE CORNER BRIGHT!"},{"s":251.26,"e":254.35,"text":"You don't need the ending to know where to start,"},{"s":254.35,"e":257.19,"text":"Write another beautiful line with your heart!"},{"s":257.19,"e":259.59,"text":"One small kindness, one beautiful day,"},{"s":259.59,"e":261.99,"text":"One more chance to love along the way."},{"s":261.99,"e":264.07,"text":"A hundred books could never write"},{"s":264.07,"e":266.35,"text":"The life you're making here tonight."},{"s":266.35,"e":267.8,"text":"Make one corner bright."},{"s":267.8,"e":269.25,"text":"Make one corner bright."},{"s":269.25,"e":272.22,"text":"And we'll shine a little brighter side by side."}],"duration":272.72,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}